      "content": "it's not just a \"failure\" though. it's not something i can just pivot from. three years of my life are just gone. everyone expects me to be this brilliant researcher and now i'm just... nothing. i look at the door to the lab and i just feel sick. i feel like if i walk in there, i'm just walking into a room full of people waiting to watch me fail. honestly, what's even the point of trying to rebuild when the foundation is just totally broken? it feels like everything i was supposed to be just vanished.",
